相关后续工作
================================================================================

这篇文献是相对论平均场理论在有限核应用的奠基性工作之一，后续相关工作包括：

1. P. Ring, "Relativistic mean field theory in finite nuclei", Prog. Part. Nucl. Phys. 37, 193-263 (1996)
2. M. Bender et al., "Self-consistent relativistic mean field models for nuclear structure", Rev. Mod. Phys. 75, 121 (2003)
3. J. Meng et al., "Relativistic mean field theory and its applications in nuclear physics", Prog. Part. Nucl. Phys. 57, 470-563 (2006)

